# 97. Testing Architecture

The frontend testing pyramid should include:

```text
unit tests
component tests
integration tests
workflow tests
end-to-end tests
visual regression where useful
accessibility tests
```

---

# 98. Unit Tests

Test:

```text
pure logic
formatters
selectors
state utilities
validation
permission helpers
```

---

# 99. Component Tests

Test:

```text
rendering
states
interaction
accessibility
error behavior
```

---

# 100. Integration Tests

Test:

```text
screen
+
query
+
mutation
+
state reconciliation
```

---

# 101. End-to-End Tests

Test complete operational journeys.

The most important E2E test is not:

```text
"Does the dashboard render?"
```

It is:

```text
Can a user move from detection
through assessment
through investigation
through response
through recovery
through institutional learning
without the application losing state?
```

---

# 102. Visual Testing

Visual regression should protect:

```text
layout
spacing
typography
component states
responsive behavior
critical screen composition
```

But visual correctness must never substitute for functional correctness.

