# 123. Master Frontend Invariants

### Invariant 01

The API is the authoritative source of operational state.

### Invariant 02

The frontend never invents domain truth.

### Invariant 03

The frontend never bypasses API contracts.

### Invariant 04

Every consequential action has explicit loading, success, and failure states.

### Invariant 05

Invalid domain transitions are rejected by the backend.

### Invariant 06

Real-time events reconcile application state.

### Invariant 07

Disconnected state is visible.

### Invariant 08

Critical information is never communicated by color alone.

### Invariant 09

The 13-screen registry remains authoritative.

### Invariant 10

AI-generated UI must ultimately connect to real application architecture.

